<title>DENMARK: Danish Superfos 1996 profits well up.</title>
<headline>Danish Superfos 1996 profits well up.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net result			   300 vs 258</p>
<p> Pre-tax &amp; extra items result	   325 vs 269.1</p>
<p> Group net turnover			5,417 vs 4,861</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (crowns per share)   18 vs 15</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish construction, chemicals and packaging group is Superfos A/S. It said in a statement that it expected a 15-20 percent better 1997 result after tax and extraordinary items. The result was more or less in line with average analyst expectations of a 304 million crown 1996 net profit.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969650</p>
